.SH "🏁 Goal"
.PP
This package provides utility functions and classes for make ESLint custom rules\&.

.PP
For examples:

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fR\fRgetStaticValue\fP\fP evaluates static value on AST\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fR\fRReferenceTracker\fP\fP checks the members of modules/globals as handling assignments and destructuring\&.
.PP
