.SS "Development Tools"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRnpm run test-coverage\fP runs tests and measures coverage\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRnpm run clean\fP removes the coverage result of \fRnpm run test-coverage\fP command\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRnpm run coverage\fP shows the coverage result of the last \fRnpm run test-coverage\fP command\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRnpm run lint\fP runs ESLint\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRnpm run watch\fP runs tests on each file change\&. 
